[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NAN_DU]
Investigate §YNan Du§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NAN_DU_desc]
Though it is unlikely to be the destination of smuggling, as it is located deep in the center of Kirin commune territory, Nan Du is the administrative center of the Eastern Region. Perhaps we can find some clues in those documents.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NAN_DU]
调查§Y南都§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NAN_DU_desc]
虽然这里地处麒麟社群的腹地，不太可能是走私的目的地，但南都是东部地区的行政中心，也许我们可以在那些文件中找到蛛丝马迹。
